"""subpowers-mcp: zero-dependency stdio MCP server for subpowers.

Works with Claude Code, Antigravity, Codex, Cursor, Grok, Hermes, and any
JSON-RPC 2.0 MCP client. Supports both newline-delimited JSON (MCP stdio spec)
and Content-Length framed messages automatically.
"""
